  - m_Id: 22781526355968
    m_Localized: Green Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716096
    m_Localized: Ember Moth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716097
    m_Localized: Water Snowman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716098
    m_Localized: Whirl Snail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716099
    m_Localized: Lodestone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716100
    m_Localized: Blood Spore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716101
    m_Localized: Tide Spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716102
    m_Localized: A life of flowers with the power to control water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716103
    m_Localized: Raging Tide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716104
    m_Localized: Uses the powerful Cataract every third round, starting in round
      3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716105
    m_Localized: Re-form the Tide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716106
    m_Localized: The first time its HP falls below 20% of max HP, it attempts a special
      skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716107
    m_Localized: Red Lantern
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781555716108
    m_Localized: A red lamp and a disturbing hot plate around it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910400
    m_Localized: Burnout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910401
    m_Localized: Uses a special skill after several rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910402
    m_Localized: Kindling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910403
    m_Localized: Changes form when it reaches 3 stacks of Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910404
    m_Localized: Flame Lantern
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910405
    m_Localized: Immune to Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910406
    m_Localized: Encroaching Darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910407
    m_Localized: 'The Messenger of darkness,

      try not to be swallowed by the
      darkness it brings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910408
    m_Localized: Encroaching Darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910409
    m_Localized: Darkness descends in round 9.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910410
    m_Localized: No More Hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910411
    m_Localized: "Grants Hope to every combatant.\nSome of its skills have Power
      \u22125 when clashing against Hope."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910412
    m_Localized: No More Pain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910413
    m_Localized: Takes 90% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910414
    m_Localized: No More Haste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910415
    m_Localized: Speed is fixed at 4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910416
    m_Localized: Little Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910417
    m_Localized: From a cute little cat, it's hostile to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910418
    m_Localized: Kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910419
    m_Localized: Forgives you at the start of round 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910420
    m_Localized: Thunderlord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910421
    m_Localized: The king born in the land of Leyun, defeating it means true victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910422
    m_Localized: Living Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910423
    m_Localized: Immune to lightning statuses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910424
    m_Localized: Radiant Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910425
    m_Localized: He will be the knight of the white gold. He will first press down
      the target rhythm with blood and a lock of light and then spark the enemy into
      the darkness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910426
    m_Localized: Marked for Judgment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910427
    m_Localized: Radiant Charge prioritizes targets with at least 2 different debuffs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910428
    m_Localized: Shield of Judgment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910429
    m_Localized: If any target has a debuff, Verdict Shield grants the user Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910430
    m_Localized: The Wicked Queen's Hunter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910431
    m_Localized: 'After releasing the princess, she was tortured by the queen to
      confess.

      The suffering and the darkness were all over her life.

      every
      night she dreams of pain with a tearing skin and a thousand needles.

      I''m
      not letting any of the prey go.

      She said.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910432
    m_Localized: Clear Quarry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910433
    m_Localized: Periodically uses Designate Target and prioritizes marked targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910434
    m_Localized: Hunter's Hound
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910435
    m_Localized: 'He does not understand what evil is evil and evil.

      He only
      knows who his master says he will bite.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910436
    m_Localized: Loyal Hound
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910437
    m_Localized: When the Wicked Queen's Hunter dies, this hound loses 5 Speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910438
    m_Localized: On the Scent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910439
    m_Localized: Always attacks marked targets if any are present.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910440
    m_Localized: Bloodthirsty Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910441
    m_Localized: Dirty, ravishing, greedy, typical rodents, like to appear in piles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910442
    m_Localized: Rat Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910443
    m_Localized: Gains 1 stack of Weakness when another Bloodthirsty Rat dies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910444
    m_Localized: Call from Beyond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910445
    m_Localized: 'The machine that was found from the other side.

      who is it
      looking for? where is it going?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910446
    m_Localized: This Side of the Veil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910447
    m_Localized: Periodically sleeps for several rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910448
    m_Localized: Call from Beyond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910449
    m_Localized: 'The machine that was found from the other side.

      who is it
      looking for? where is it going?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910450
    m_Localized: This Side of the Veil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910451
    m_Localized: Periodically sleeps for several rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910452
    m_Localized: Crimson Broodmother
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910453
    m_Localized: The mother of the blood of the body. It waits patiently for the
      blood in the object to be out of control and then to tear the prey apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910454
    m_Localized: Abnormal Clotting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910455
    m_Localized: While present, allies no longer lose Bleed stacks when attacked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910456
    m_Localized: Scent of Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910457
    m_Localized: Switches to phase 2 when any combatant reaches 3 stacks of Bleed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910458
    m_Localized: Bloodletting Execution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910459
    m_Localized: In phase 2, uses a powerful execution skill every 3 rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910460
    m_Localized: Giant Green Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910461
    m_Localized: The venom rolls in it. This larger Slam is good at self-defeating
      for oppression and can split again when he is alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910462
    m_Localized: Venom Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910463
    m_Localized: Immune to Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910464
    m_Localized: Splitting Instinct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910465
    m_Localized: Prioritizes Split when it is the only combatant left on its side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910466
    m_Localized: Red Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910467
    m_Localized: The event monster. It will be immersed with poison and will be more
      aggressive by alienation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910468
    m_Localized: Crimson Resistance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910469
    m_Localized: Immune to Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910470
    m_Localized: Frostash Moth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910471
    m_Localized: The moths that entangle cold with the rest of their remains. It
      is good at freezing the target and then they blow up into stronger strikes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910472
    m_Localized: Winterborn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910473
    m_Localized: Immune to Chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910474
    m_Localized: Wire Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910475
    m_Localized: The puppets woven with wires rely on electricity savings and imports
      to reverse the fighting rhythm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910476
    m_Localized: Drowned Bonepicker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910477
    m_Localized: A sewr whose bones are soaked by sea water. It will spill water
      and repair itself with the tidal marks on its companions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910478
    m_Localized: Rising Tide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910479
    m_Localized: At the start of every other round, all living enemies gain 1 stack
      of Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910480
    m_Localized: Bonepicker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910481
    m_Localized: Survives fatal damage at 1 HP until every other living ally has
      1 HP or less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910482
    m_Localized: Rotbloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910483
    m_Localized: The twig-dwelling plant monster, which is so sweetly corrupted,
      is good at spreading poisoning and calling new friends when few people are
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910484
    m_Localized: Supple Petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910485
    m_Localized: At the start of each round, gains Temporary Guard equal to the highest
      Poison stack count among living allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910486
    m_Localized: Flayed Disciple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910487
    m_Localized: Mad believers who have taken their blood to their faith. They will
      strip their skins and then seek life from their targets with a blood debt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910488
    m_Localized: Sacrifice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910489
    m_Localized: If injured by its own skill, gains 1 stack of Temporary Strength
      at the start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910490
    m_Localized: Headwind Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910491
    m_Localized: The shooter adjusts the ballistics in the face of the wind. It is
      not good at purely force collisions, but it pulls its opponent into its rhythm
      with speed differentials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910492
    m_Localized: Catch the Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910493
    m_Localized: Clash Power +1 when its Speed is higher than the target's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910494
    m_Localized: Ash Priest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910495
    m_Localized: The priest who has accomplished the transfer and atonement ritual
      in the ashes. It will send the disaster to its target and its negative state
      to its opponent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910496
    m_Localized: Broken-Horn Gatekeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910497
    m_Localized: The gate keeper with the broken horn shield. In phase 1, it will
      be able to prevent the break-off of the anti-earthquake and, after severe damage,
      to move to a more offensive break-off posture.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910498
    m_Localized: Hold the Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910499
    m_Localized: In phase 1, winning a clash with a defense die deals damage to the
      target equal to the clash margin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910500
    m_Localized: Broken Horn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910501
    m_Localized: In phase 2, Hold the Gate ends. Winning a clash grants +1 Power
      to its next attack skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910502
    m_Localized: Lightning Rod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910503
    m_Localized: It collects electricity from the battlefield using broken circuits,
      which triggers uncontrolled discharge when the charge is sufficiently intensive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910504
    m_Localized: Call Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910505
    m_Localized: "Every 3 rounds starting in round 3, triggers a 1\xD7 Shock Burst
      on every combatant, including itself, then clears their Shock stacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910506
    m_Localized: Charge Transfer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910507
    m_Localized: Whenever a combatant with at least 1 stack of Shock deals damage,
      transfer 1 of its Shock stacks to the target it damaged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910508
    m_Localized: Mirror Bearer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910509
    m_Localized: The middle-level light-related enemy. It does not rush to kill immediately,
      but rather increases the negative state of the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910510
    m_Localized: Clean Mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910511
    m_Localized: Gains 2 stacks of Shield when its attack hits a target with a debuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910512
    m_Localized: Embermark Lizard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910513
    m_Localized: The middle-level inflammation is the enemy. It sustains life with
      burning, and every fire in the field is feeding it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910514
    m_Localized: Cauterizing Scales
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910515
    m_Localized: When any combatant takes Burn damage, this creature heals for the
      same amount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910516
    m_Localized: Blood Spider Egg
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910517
    m_Localized: The eggs of the blood. When they have hatched, they only protect
      themselves and when they lose hatch, they begin to turn into tiny blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910518
    m_Localized: Hatch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910519
    m_Localized: At round start, becomes a Blood Spiderling if it has no Incubation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910520
    m_Localized: Blood Spiderling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910521
    m_Localized: A small caller that has just crawled from the eggs of blood would
      instinctively pursue the bloodiest target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910522
    m_Localized: Bloodfeast Spider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910523
    m_Localized: It eats blood, and does not know the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910524
    m_Localized: Hunger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910525
    m_Localized: Prioritizes Kin Feast every 5 rounds. Devouring a Blood Spiderling
      heals the spider for its remaining HP, grants Temporary Strength, and applies
      1 stack of Bleed to all targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910526
    m_Localized: Blood Brood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910527
    m_Localized: When no other allies are present, prioritizes Spider Brood. Summons
      2 Blood Spider Eggs at the start of the next round. If Spider Brood loses its
      clash, the summoned eggs lose 50% of their HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910528
    m_Localized: Reflection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910529
    m_Localized: It's not like the enemy, it's like the reflection of the battlefield
      in the dark. What you did in the last round, you find a colder echo on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910530
    m_Localized: No Self
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910531
    m_Localized: Its number of speed slots equals the combined number of speed dice
      of all targets in the previous round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910532
    m_Localized: As You Are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910533
    m_Localized: Uses skills the opposing side used in the previous round. Copies
      their dice and effects into Forsake Me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910534
    m_Localized: Darkened
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910535
    m_Localized: At battle start, gains 1 stack of Strength, 1 of Guard, and 10 of
      Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910536
    m_Localized: Stray Afterimage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910537
    m_Localized: The shadow of the strange road is as fragile as an unspoken answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910538
    m_Localized: Concealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910539
    m_Localized: Gains 1 stack of Immunity at the start of round 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910540
    m_Localized: Wandering Phantom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910541
    m_Localized: He is more complete than the shadow, but he is not a true man. He
      will divide himself and sew the darkness back into him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910542
    m_Localized: Concealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910543
    m_Localized: Gains 1 stack of Immunity at the start of round 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910544
    m_Localized: Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910545
    m_Localized: The echo from which it is heard. It can make the shadows more and
      the companions more like themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910546
    m_Localized: Emptiness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910547
    m_Localized: Gains 3 stacks of Immunity at the start of round 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910548
    m_Localized: Mindless Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910549
    m_Localized: Empty shells pulled by the line, with no eyes on the face, all of
      the killings came from the other side of the line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910550
    m_Localized: Mindless
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910551
    m_Localized: "Attack skill Power \u22121 against targets without Mark."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910552
    m_Localized: Stringmaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910553
    m_Localized: He did not go to the battle, but raised his finger in the shadows.
      Each line had its own orders and every shell suffered pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910554
    m_Localized: Puppet Strings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910555
    m_Localized: While Mindless Puppets are present, redirects all incoming damage
      to a random Mindless Puppet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910556
    m_Localized: Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910557
    m_Localized: It's waiting for someone to clear the bill on the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910558
    m_Localized: Pay Your Debts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910559
    m_Localized: Any combatant that reaches 3 stacks of Debt dies immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910560
    m_Localized: Obsession Made Flesh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910561
    m_Localized: Immune to all damage except from its own Honor the Wager passive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910562
    m_Localized: Honor the Wager
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910563
    m_Localized: Takes 1 damage when it loses a clash against Gamble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910564
    m_Localized: At the Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910565
    m_Localized: At battle start, grants Gamble and Sleight of Hand to all targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910566
    m_Localized: Black Coffin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910567
    m_Localized: The cold black coffin dragged along the ground and put the ominous
      darkness into the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910568
    m_Localized: Ocean Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910569
    m_Localized: The ocean current trapped in the battlefields was squished repeatedly
      by the cracks on the target and accumulated Erosion in the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910570
    m_Localized: Undertow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910571
    m_Localized: At the start of each round, each target has a 50% chance to gain
      1 stack of Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910572
    m_Localized: Thunderwolf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910573
    m_Localized: The high-speed swimmers will import the current into their own bodies
      and the prey and then use their beeps to detonate the most visible charge on
      the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910574
    m_Localized: Conductive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910575
    m_Localized: At round start, gains 1 stack of Temporary Strength if it has 10
      stacks of Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910576
    m_Localized: Bright Prism Sentinel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910577
    m_Localized: The attack was magnified by the glimmer of light from the bright
      side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910578
    m_Localized: Alternating Radiance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910579
    m_Localized: Begins the battle with Bright Face. At round end, swaps Bright Face
      and Dark Face with the Dark Prism Sentinel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910580
    m_Localized: Bright-Side Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910581
    m_Localized: With Bright Face, its attack skills gain +1 max Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910582
    m_Localized: Sole Radiance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910583
    m_Localized: When the Dark Prism Sentinel dies, Alternating Radiance ends and
      this sentinel keeps Bright Face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910584
    m_Localized: Dark Prism Sentinel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910585
    m_Localized: A shadow-ridden prism stagger who is good at slowing the target
      rhythm with shield and radiance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910586
    m_Localized: Alternating Radiance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910587
    m_Localized: Begins the battle with Dark Face. At round end, swaps Bright Face
      and Dark Face with the Bright Prism Sentinel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910588
    m_Localized: Dark-Side Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910589
    m_Localized: With Dark Face, all its defense dice gain +1 max Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910590
    m_Localized: Sole Radiance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910591
    m_Localized: When the Bright Prism Sentinel dies, Alternating Radiance ends and
      this sentinel keeps Dark Face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910592
    m_Localized: Bloodbone Heir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910593
    m_Localized: 'The last memory of the prince in the diary.

      the bitterness
      of hatred is enough to swallow everything.

      Desperate!

      You can''t
      leave alive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910594
    m_Localized: Rebel King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910595
    m_Localized: The two princes who were in history, in order to take the throne
      from their brothers, sent soldiers to their fathers and set up their brother's
      sins. The evil lord.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910596
    m_Localized: Revenant Noble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910597
    m_Localized: The housekeeper of the past, the enemy of the day. You will not
      be used for the battles of the men who have come all the way, will you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910598
    m_Localized: Severed Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910599
    m_Localized: A puppet with a broken line, you saved it from the puppet master.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910600
    m_Localized: Crash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910601
    m_Localized: Flame Moth Ignite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910602
    m_Localized: Flame Moth Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910603
    m_Localized: Flying Kick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910604
    m_Localized: How did it do that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910605
    m_Localized: Speed Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910606
    m_Localized: It looks like it's gathering strength...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910607
    m_Localized: Swirl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910608
    m_Localized: It spins into a ball and hurtles toward its foe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910609
    m_Localized: Magtronic Burst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910610
    m_Localized: An ominous current crackles around it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910611
    m_Localized: Magtronic Conduct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910612
    m_Localized: It tingles, but it doesn't seem to hurt that much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910613
    m_Localized: Blood Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910614
    m_Localized: Try to stay clear of its blood-red spines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910615
    m_Localized: Suck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910616
    m_Localized: It spreads its tentacles...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910617
    m_Localized: Cataract
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910618
    m_Localized: Is that... an enormous waterfall?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910619
    m_Localized: Vortex Pull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910620
    m_Localized: It's forming a whirlpool. Don't get pulled in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910621
    m_Localized: Wave Reconstruct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910622
    m_Localized: It's trying to pull itself back together. Stop it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910623
    m_Localized: Wave Splash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910624
    m_Localized: It summons a formidable wall of waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910625
    m_Localized: Douse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910626
    m_Localized: The flame is burning out. Don't let it rekindle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910627
    m_Localized: Dusk Dart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910628
    m_Localized: Something black gathers around the lantern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910629
    m_Localized: Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910630
    m_Localized: Flames condense around the wick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910631
    m_Localized: Lamp Prison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910632
    m_Localized: A crimson cage of fire is opening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910633
    m_Localized: Creep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910634
    m_Localized: Darkness is spreading.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910635
    m_Localized: End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910636
    m_Localized: Darkness has arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910637
    m_Localized: Hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910638
    m_Localized: There is always a little hope deep inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910639
    m_Localized: Shadow Pierce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910640
    m_Localized: Darkness forms a blade in its hand. Don't let it run you through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910641
    m_Localized: Scratch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910642
    m_Localized: The little cat reaches out a paw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910643
    m_Localized: He's a Dead Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910644
    m_Localized: A thrust that pierces the sky. Can you stand against it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910645
    m_Localized: One Shot at the World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910646
    m_Localized: Do you know what it feels like to be struck by lightning?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910647
    m_Localized: The Thunder Is On the Ground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910648
    m_Localized: Uh-oh. It's angry now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910649
    m_Localized: Magnetic Thunderlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910650
    m_Localized: Lightning's coming down, kid!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910651
    m_Localized: The Thunderstorm Is Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910652
    m_Localized: It thrusts its lightning spear, the tip crackling without end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910653
    m_Localized: I'll Be Punished By the Death Penalty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910654
    m_Localized: Here's the finisher, kid!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910655
    m_Localized: Thunder Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910656
    m_Localized: It thrusts its lightning spear, electricity snapping at the tip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910657
    m_Localized: I'll Cut It Straight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910658
    m_Localized: Sacred light sinks into the blade, leaving a delayed judgment in
      the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910659
    m_Localized: St. Light Is Locked in Prison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910660
    m_Localized: Shackles of light rise from the ground, slowing every step of your
      escape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910661
    m_Localized: Radiant Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910662
    m_Localized: A white-gold trail cuts across the field toward those who have already
      shown a weakness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910663
    m_Localized: Verdict Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910664
    m_Localized: The knight raises its shield, reflecting the light back from those
      it has judged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910665
    m_Localized: Tow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910666
    m_Localized: The hound lunges, teeth and claws bared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910667
    m_Localized: Designate Target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910668
    m_Localized: She watches you with a cold stare, looking for a weakness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910669
    m_Localized: Fire!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910670
    m_Localized: 'She waits for her prey to expose a weakness.

      Now she knows
      it''s time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910671
    m_Localized: Rotfang Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910672
    m_Localized: Its pointed maw is smeared with blood and rotten flesh. Don't let
      it touch you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910673
    m_Localized: Call
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910674
    m_Localized: You hear distant weeping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910675
    m_Localized: Sleep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910676
    m_Localized: The call has stopped... for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910677
    m_Localized: Execute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910678
    m_Localized: Every drop of spilled blood sharpens its executioner's blade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910679
    m_Localized: Rend Feast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910680
    m_Localized: It grows more excited as your wounds deepen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910681
    m_Localized: Siphon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910682
    m_Localized: It is gathering the blood that was spilled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910683
    m_Localized: Vein Pierce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910684
    m_Localized: Razor-sharp filaments of blood erupt from its body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910685
    m_Localized: Assimilate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910686
    m_Localized: At the start of the next round, the target gains 2 stacks of Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910687
    m_Localized: Sacrificial Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910688
    m_Localized: On use, deal 2 damage to the user. On a one-sided attack, each die
      deals 2 extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910689
    m_Localized: Split
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910690
    m_Localized: On use, summon 2 Green Slimes and deal 3 damage to the user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910691
    m_Localized: Corrode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910692
    m_Localized: On hit, apply 2 stacks of Poison at the start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910693
    m_Localized: Mass Decay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910694
    m_Localized: Each die that hits applies 1 stack of Poison to all targets at the
      start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910695
    m_Localized: Mutate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910696
    m_Localized: On use, gain 1 stack of Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910697
    m_Localized: Cold Ember Flutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910698
    m_Localized: On hit, apply 1 stack of Chill at the start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910699
    m_Localized: Dimming Scale Dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910700
    m_Localized: 'Die 1: On Clash, Power +1 if the target has Chill. Die 2: On Hit,
      apply 1 stack of Chill at the start of the next round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910701
    m_Localized: Ember Huddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910702
    m_Localized: On use, clear all Chill from the target and gain the same amount
      of Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910703
    m_Localized: Current Halo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910704
    m_Localized: On hit, apply 2 stacks of Shock to the target. On a one-sided attack,
      also apply 1 stack of Slow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910705
    m_Localized: Grounding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910706
    m_Localized: On use, gain 3 stacks of Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910707
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910708
    m_Localized: "Power +1 when clashing with a target that has Shock. Triggers a
      1\xD7 Shock Burst on hit or miss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910709
    m_Localized: Bone Tide Reclaim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910710
    m_Localized: On use, heal the user for 2 HP if any target has Erosion. On hit,
      deal 1 extra damage if the target has Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781559910711
    m_Localized: Sunken Prayer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104704
    m_Localized: On clash win, apply 1 stack of Erosion to all targets at the start
      of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104705
    m_Localized: Undertow Drag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104706
    m_Localized: On a one-sided attack, apply 2 stacks of Erosion. On hit, apply
      1 more stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104707
    m_Localized: Rot Fragrance Breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104708
    m_Localized: Its secretions smell sweet. You know better than to trust them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104709
    m_Localized: Spore Bloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104710
    m_Localized: Anything it devours comes back in another form.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104711
    m_Localized: Sweet Collapse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104712
    m_Localized: Don't fall. Don't give in. Remember that you're still fighting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104713
    m_Localized: Blood Debt Recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104714
    m_Localized: Every debt of blood will be repaid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104715
    m_Localized: Skin Riven Liturgy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104716
    m_Localized: Its skin splits and blood pours out. In this moment, only faith
      remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104717
    m_Localized: Reverse Wind Arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104718
    m_Localized: The arrow doesn't fly against the wind. It cuts right through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104719
    m_Localized: Severing Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104720
    m_Localized: Struck prey falls like a kite with a severed string.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104721
    m_Localized: Side Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104722
    m_Localized: He slips aside with a light step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104723
    m_Localized: Atonement Transfer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104724
    m_Localized: A wicked spell that passes the caster's pain to someone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104725
    m_Localized: Calamity Invocation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104726
    m_Localized: The sound of Calamity won't stop. The hair on your neck stands up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104727
    m_Localized: Broken Horn Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104728
    m_Localized: This is its only attack. Try to intercept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104729
    m_Localized: Quake Warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104730
    m_Localized: It stomps the ground as if to warn you away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104731
    m_Localized: Shield Horn Intercept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104732
    m_Localized: A heavy shield blocks your retreat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104733
    m_Localized: Threshold Smash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104734
    m_Localized: It brings its shield crashing down. Few can withstand the blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104735
    m_Localized: High Voltage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104736
    m_Localized: Three blinding blue-white arcs lash out between the insulators like
      a power line gone wild.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104737
    m_Localized: Superconduct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104738
    m_Localized: It draws in the lingering charge. A blinding current races along
      the pole.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104739
    m_Localized: Transformer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104740
    m_Localized: A low hum comes from somewhere nearby...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104741
    m_Localized: Mirror Shard Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104742
    m_Localized: A broken shard slips from its sleeve, stabbing only at shadows that
      already have cracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104743
    m_Localized: Sin Litany
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104744
    m_Localized: It mouths a silent prayer. The figure in the mirror bows first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104745
    m_Localized: White Mirror Corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104746
    m_Localized: A white mirror stretches the battlefield, sending each step on without
      end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104747
    m_Localized: Curl Counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104748
    m_Localized: The scales lock together like a hot shield, then a tongue of flame
      shoots through the gaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104749
    m_Localized: Flame Surge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104750
    m_Localized: Fire rolls across the ground, burning deeper into open wounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104751
    m_Localized: Roast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104752
    m_Localized: It crouches low. The markings on its back glow like vents in a stoked
      furnace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104753
    m_Localized: Hatch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104754
    m_Localized: The membrane swells and contracts in a crimson rhythm. Something
      inside is learning to breathe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104755
    m_Localized: Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104756
    m_Localized: It hunts by the scent of blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104757
    m_Localized: Blood Thread Snare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104758
    m_Localized: Red threads creep along the ground toward those not yet marked by
      the scent of blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104759
    m_Localized: Kin Feast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104760
    m_Localized: Hunger overcomes its brood instinct. It turns and bites one of its
      own young.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104761
    m_Localized: Spider Brood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104762
    m_Localized: It presses its belly to the ground. Blood-red egg sacs roll out
      of the shadows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104763
    m_Localized: Forsake Me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104764
    m_Localized: It folds itself into a plane of darkness, leaving an empty space
      behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104765
    m_Localized: Dark Shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104766
    m_Localized: A black cut left at the crossroads deepens when nothing stands in
      its way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104767
    m_Localized: Blend Into Shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104768
    m_Localized: It gathers the afterimages around itself like scraps of night stitched
      into a coat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104769
    m_Localized: Dark Shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104770
    m_Localized: Its phantom blade is light, but even a miss leaves a second cut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104771
    m_Localized: Morph
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104772
    m_Localized: It backs into the dark and tears its outline into thinner shadows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104773
    m_Localized: Blur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104774
    m_Localized: Its edges dissolve. The shadows at its side rise another inch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104775
    m_Localized: Morph
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104776
    m_Localized: As the echo fades, shadows with no owners appear on the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104777
    m_Localized: Silence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104778
    m_Localized: It presses sound into shadow until even your breathing falls a beat
      behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104779
    m_Localized: Obey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104780
    m_Localized: Wooden joints clatter. The puppet has no will, only the direction
      of its strings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104781
    m_Localized: Sacrifice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104782
    m_Localized: The strings snap taut, squeezing the puppet into a blade that feels
      no pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104783
    m_Localized: Manipulate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104784
    m_Localized: Threads fall from its fingertips, catching joints before sewing
      orders into the skin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104785
    m_Localized: Offering Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104786
    m_Localized: The stringmaster pulls the lines tight. The orders drive back into
      its palm like nails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104787
    m_Localized: Sleight of Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104788
    m_Localized: Something slips out of its sleeve. A page quietly disappears from
      the ledger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104789
    m_Localized: Gamble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104790
    m_Localized: Dice roll through the darkness. Until they stop, no one knows what
      they have wagered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104791
    m_Localized: Gamble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104792
    m_Localized: The table falls silent. One die speaks for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104793
    m_Localized: Close Coffin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104794
    m_Localized: The lid shuts with a snap. Whoever is inside is cut off from the
      living world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104795
    m_Localized: Coffin Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104796
    m_Localized: 'Thud. Thud. Thud.

      It drives the nail into itself, inch by
      inch. You grow colder with every blow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104797
    m_Localized: Shallow Tide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104798
    m_Localized: Prioritizes the target with the most Erosion stacks. On use, all
      dice gain +1 Power if the target has at least 10 stacks of Vulnerable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104799
    m_Localized: Surge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104800
    m_Localized: Two surging hits. On hit, die 1 applies 1 stack of Erosion. On hit,
      die 2 triggers the target's Erosion once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104801
    m_Localized: Howl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104802
    m_Localized: "Targets the combatant with the most Shock stacks. On hit, die 1
      triggers a 1\xD7 Shock Burst without consuming Shock. Die 2 triggers a 1\xD7
      Shock Burst on hit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104803
    m_Localized: Magnetic Claw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104804
    m_Localized: On hit, apply 2 stacks of Shock to the user and 2 to the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104805
    m_Localized: Phase Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104806
    m_Localized: Defense skill. On hit, die 1 applies 2 stacks of Shock to the user
      and target. On clash, die 2 gains +1 Power if the user has Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104807
    m_Localized: Backlight Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104808
    m_Localized: The dark facet braces in front, catching the incoming force in a
      cold, bright frame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104809
    m_Localized: Dusk Face Return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104810
    m_Localized: The dark facet's light never goes out. It waits to bend back into
      the same wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104811
    m_Localized: Front Face Cleave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104812
    m_Localized: The active facet lights up. Its edge compresses the light into a
      thin line along the old mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104813
    m_Localized: Prism Return Mapping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104814
    m_Localized: Light bends back from the other face, tracing the same path across
      the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104815
    m_Localized: Refracted Deflection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104816
    m_Localized: The facet tilts and bends a straight attack toward the slowest shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104817
    m_Localized: Refracted Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104818
    m_Localized: A ray stabs diagonally along the lit face, leaving little white
      scratches wherever it strikes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104819
    m_Localized: Blood in a Thousand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104820
    m_Localized: The blood-soaked will left on the battlefield becomes threads that
      bind the living and drain their vitality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104821
    m_Localized: The Ancient War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104822
    m_Localized: There's No Blood in the World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104823
    m_Localized: Blood Is Cut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104824
    m_Localized: The heir brings his sword down in a furious, heavy blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104825
    m_Localized: Bleeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104826
    m_Localized: King of the Dead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104827
    m_Localized: The Thorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104828
    m_Localized: The Fire Cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104829
    m_Localized: The Cold Water Curtain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104830
    m_Localized: The Clairvoyant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104831
    m_Localized: There's No Peace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104832
    m_Localized: The Scavity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104833
    m_Localized: The Shadow of the Vanity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104834
    m_Localized: Scapegoat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104835
    m_Localized: It knows nothing of pain. It only knows it must keep the enemy away
      from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104836
    m_Localized: Wooden Sword Block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104837
    m_Localized: A simple sword technique that softens incoming blows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104838
    m_Localized: Wooden Sword Normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104839
    m_Localized: A simple slash that uses the sword's momentum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104840
    m_Localized: Wooden Sword Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104841
    m_Localized: Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104842
    m_Localized: A simple slash that uses the sword's momentum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104843
    m_Localized: Chop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104844
    m_Localized: A sweeping slash that reaches every enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104845
    m_Localized: Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104846
    m_Localized: A simple slash that uses the sword's momentum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104847
    m_Localized: He's Burning Up and He's Cutting Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104848
    m_Localized: Sweep the blazing blade through the enemy and make them feel the
      cut twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104849
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104850
    m_Localized: Light the blade and let it set the enemy alight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104851
    m_Localized: The Cold Is Cold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104852
    m_Localized: Sweep the freezing blade through the enemy and make them feel the
      cut twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104853
    m_Localized: Cold Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104854
    m_Localized: Spin the weapon to send a cold gust toward the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104855
    m_Localized: Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104856
    m_Localized: A simple slash that uses the sword's momentum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104857
    m_Localized: Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104858
    m_Localized: A simple slash that uses the sword's momentum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104859
    m_Localized: Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104860
    m_Localized: This blade holds its prey like a venomous snake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104861
    m_Localized: He's Dead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104862
    m_Localized: A venomous sword technique whose Power depends on the target's Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104863
    m_Localized: I Swear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104864
    m_Localized: Draw the blood back from the wound and feel its warmth return to
      your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104865
    m_Localized: Don't Think About It
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104866
    m_Localized: Two cuts are enough to sever the will to live.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104867
    m_Localized: The Stuns Are Stunned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104868
    m_Localized: The tip follows the line of blood, threading one wound to the next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104869
    m_Localized: Blood Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104870
    m_Localized: A shallow cut is enough for the blade to remember the taste of blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104871
    m_Localized: The Puncture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104872
    m_Localized: The light exposes every wound on the enemy's body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104873
    m_Localized: He's Dead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104874
    m_Localized: Judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104875
    m_Localized: Morning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104876
    m_Localized: A strike that opens with a flash of white light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104877
    m_Localized: Clean
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104878
    m_Localized: Point the pale light along the blade at the most dangerous foe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104879
    m_Localized: The Crowned Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104880
    m_Localized: Pin the enemy beneath a crown of fire. Deliver judgment when the
      cracks glow brightest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104881
    m_Localized: Firesticks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104882
    m_Localized: Concentrate fire in the tip. The attack is harder to withstand if
      the target is already burning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104883
    m_Localized: Back to the Ashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104884
    m_Localized: Lower the blade into a crown-shaped guard, pressing hot ash beneath
      the enemy's feet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104885
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104886
    m_Localized: The blade brushes an open wound and leaves sparks behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104887
    m_Localized: The Lights Are Still On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104888
    m_Localized: Seal the light in the blade and dampen the enemy's attack as you
      defend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104889
    m_Localized: Blindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104890
    m_Localized: Strip away the target's Darkness, leaving it briefly disoriented
      next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104891
    m_Localized: Behead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104892
    m_Localized: A shadow of gray steel presses down on the target's light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104893
    m_Localized: The Back of the Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104894
    m_Localized: Strike in quick succession from the target's own shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104895
    m_Localized: Jab!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104896
    m_Localized: A dagger thrust. Simple and effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104897
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104898
    m_Localized: It's called Backstab because a fair fight wouldn't work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104899
    m_Localized: Blade Dance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104900
    m_Localized: A knife dance is a great way to relieve stress, as long as it works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104901
    m_Localized: Ornate Cut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104902
    m_Localized: A precise and graceful finishing move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104903
    m_Localized: Quick Cut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104904
    m_Localized: Slip in a stab before anyone has time to react.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104905
    m_Localized: Quick Electrocution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104906
    m_Localized: Fast as lightning, gone like the wind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104907
    m_Localized: Tssss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104908
    m_Localized: The dagger flashes. A moment later, you're beside the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104909
    m_Localized: Ray's a Prick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104910
    m_Localized: Gather a charge at the tip and unleash a rapid series of thrusts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104911
    m_Localized: Fire Cut the Throat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104912
    m_Localized: Once the embers are buried in flesh, a last orange glint passes
      across the throat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104913
    m_Localized: The Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104914
    m_Localized: Flick the dagger up like a dying red spark lifted from a cold brazier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104915
    m_Localized: The Burns Are Pierced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104916
    m_Localized: Two quick thrusts between old and new wounds leave a lingering heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104917
    m_Localized: Shade the Moment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104918
    m_Localized: The shadow splits for an instant. Only then does the blood catch
      up to the blade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104919
    m_Localized: Sprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104920
    m_Localized: An afterimage flashes past your feet. The tip arrives before your
      next breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104921
    m_Localized: The Wind Is Out of Place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104922
    m_Localized: The blade twists as if to cut the oncoming wind in two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104923
    m_Localized: Misshooting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104924
    m_Localized: The first cut breaks their rhythm. The second lands before they
      recover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104925
    m_Localized: The Casket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104926
    m_Localized: Drive the coffin nail into the shadow. In deep enough Darkness,
      it echoes like a coffin lid closing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104927
    m_Localized: The Nails!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104928
    m_Localized: Pry up the coffin nail through a crack in the dark. The deeper the
      shadow, the deeper the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104929
    m_Localized: Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104930
    m_Localized: Sink a long coffin nail into the target and leave cold Darkness
      in the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104931
    m_Localized: Chop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104932
    m_Localized: Swing without any plan. At least the enemy can't predict what you're
      doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104933
    m_Localized: Big Bang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104934
    m_Localized: Raise the axe in both hands and throw yourself into the blow. It
      hurts you a little, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104935
    m_Localized: Blood Sweep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104936
    m_Localized: "\u201CI call this Bloodmark Sweep!\u201D\n\u201CSure. So why are
      you the one bleeding?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104937
    m_Localized: Bloodburst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104938
    m_Localized: "\u201CBLOOD-SHATTERING SLASH!\u201D\n\u201CDoes he realize how
      over-the-top he sounds?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104939
    m_Localized: Bone Cleave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104940
    m_Localized: "\u201CI call this Bone-Splitting Chop!\u201D\n\u201CRight. Then
      why are you the one bleeding?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104941
    m_Localized: The Electric Field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104942
    m_Localized: Generate an electric field to apply Shock to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104943
    m_Localized: Electricity Through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104944
    m_Localized: Chop with a charged axe and drive Shock through the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104945
    m_Localized: Magnetic Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104946
    m_Localized: Unleash a magnetic storm to deal heavy Shock damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104947
    m_Localized: Juice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104948
    m_Localized: Draw the hot slag back into the blade, burning both user and target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104949
    m_Localized: The Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104950
    m_Localized: Split the lit furnace mouth and scatter sparks onto other targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104951
    m_Localized: Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104952
    m_Localized: Drive the embers into the target with a broad blade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104953
    m_Localized: Molar Throat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104954
    m_Localized: Compress the existing Burn into one powerful chop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104955
    m_Localized: Kill Him in the Dead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104956
    m_Localized: Light gathers around grime and wounds, cutting a deeper white line
      along the Refraction Mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104957
    m_Localized: "\u266A I'll Take the Light \u266A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104958
    m_Localized: The axe draws a cold white line, pinning the target to the path
      of refracted light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104959
    m_Localized: The Hunting Beheads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104960
    m_Localized: The prism core opens fully. The axe presses the Refraction Mark
      into a falling beam of execution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104961
    m_Localized: The Shire of the Sea
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104962
    m_Localized: As the axe rises to block, its prism core splits the blow into a
      screen of light that shields its companions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104963
    m_Localized: Star Impact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104964
    m_Localized: Jenny's signature spell. Years of practice come down to this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104965
    m_Localized: Do What You Want
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104966
    m_Localized: A practical spell for building up strength for the next skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104967
    m_Localized: '- I''m Not Going to Be a Man'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104968
    m_Localized: A simple defensive spell to block incoming attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104969
    m_Localized: Fill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104970
    m_Localized: Gather strength for the next move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104971
    m_Localized: Cold Rays
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104972
    m_Localized: Basic ice magic that applies Chill to the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104973
    m_Localized: The Sun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104974
    m_Localized: Jenny combines her signature spell with her staff's power. It takes
      complete concentration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104975
    m_Localized: Snowflake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104976
    m_Localized: Disrupt the enemy with a simple ice spell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104977
    m_Localized: Dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104978
    m_Localized: Press the gathered night into a verdict.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104979
    m_Localized: Night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104980
    m_Localized: Dim the battlefield with a glow that gives off no light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104981
    m_Localized: Darkstream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104982
    m_Localized: Draw out the Darkness still inside the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104983
    m_Localized: Lingering Incense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104984
    m_Localized: A faint floral scent lingers in the wound. Poison stirs a moment
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104985
    m_Localized: Flowers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104986
    m_Localized: Withered petals dissolve into a pale green mist that sinks deeper
      into already poisoned flesh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104987
    m_Localized: I'm Going to Die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104988
    m_Localized: The last petal falls, and the accumulated poison reaches full bloom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104989
    m_Localized: Spread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104990
    m_Localized: Poison mist spreads along the ground, taking the prey first and
      creeping out like vines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104991
    m_Localized: A Echo Needle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104992
    m_Localized: Hold the conductive needle forward and turn aside both the incoming
      blow and its arc of lightning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104993
    m_Localized: The Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104994
    m_Localized: Blue-white arcs race down the staff, pushing a charged target to
      the brink of a burst.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104995
    m_Localized: Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104996
    m_Localized: The staff tip gives the thunder somewhere to strike and leaves a
      dangerous echo in the caster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104997
    m_Localized: The Drop of the Thunder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104998
    m_Localized: Thunder finally falls from the clouds, pulled by a thin needle to
      the same point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564104999
    m_Localized: The Electrical Barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105000
    m_Localized: Weave thunder into a barrier and send Shock back into the target
      when you intercept its attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105001
    m_Localized: Magnetic Pulse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105002
    m_Localized: Draw fine arcs through the staff. On hit, both caster and target
      gain Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105003
    m_Localized: Thunder Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105004
    m_Localized: Pin a charge into the target, then shift phase to feed the caster's
      stored Shock into the next blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105005
    m_Localized: Ming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105006
    m_Localized: Let the charge resonate between staff and target in a series of
      thunderclaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105007
    m_Localized: ThunderLord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105008
    m_Localized: DrownedBoneCollector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105009
    m_Localized: Drowning scavengers x 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105010
