    m_Localized: The same effect when the iron wire is tied up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299009
    m_Localized: Rot-Tide Marrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299010
    m_Localized: The Sword of the Moor. I wonder why you want to shout out like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299011
    m_Localized: Thornrot Root
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299012
    m_Localized: It's a very disgusting thing, but it's actually sweet, a food that
      everybody loves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299013
    m_Localized: Heretic's Talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299014
    m_Localized: There was blood on it, and you did not understand who would make
      self-harm a creed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299015
    m_Localized: Headwind Feather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299016
    m_Localized: The feathers of the wind are strongest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299017
    m_Localized: Coffin Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299018
    m_Localized: The nails are reticenced with wet air and should not be stung by
      this ominous thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299019
    m_Localized: Bottled Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299020
    m_Localized: There's a little wave in a tiny bottle, there's nothing to stop
      it, if it's a thousand times more than a thousand times a time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299021
    m_Localized: Conductive Mane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299022
    m_Localized: The hair seemed natural, which led to a piece of hair stuck to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299023
    m_Localized: Prismatic Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299024
    m_Localized: The slides that were made on the front and back were also visible,
      and the direction of the turn was not clear which side was glowing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299025
    m_Localized: Radiant Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299026
    m_Localized: The crystal of bright eyes, which are glowing and cannot open their
      eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299027
    m_Localized: Wooden Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299028
    m_Localized: The simplest weapon for the beginners.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299029
    m_Localized: Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299030
    m_Localized: The iron sword made from the fine iron mine, which has no magic
      but is effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299031
    m_Localized: Molten Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299032
    m_Localized: The knife was filled with heat and a few sparks were spied out occasionally,
      and if not used to, a glove could be worn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299033
    m_Localized: Frost Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299034
    m_Localized: 'The cold air of the sword

      when holding the sword, the hand
      can clearly feel a cold breath.

      "You mean a free chiller?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299035
    m_Localized: Venom Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299036
    m_Localized: The swordsmith says it's just a special drug. You don't want to
      know where he said it came from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299037
    m_Localized: Bloodthirst Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299038
    m_Localized: The sword is not thirsty for blood, it remembers every wound it
      draws. When holding the handle, the palm of the sword seems to pass another
      heartbeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299039
    m_Localized: Dawnoath Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299040
    m_Localized: The body of the sword is not violent, but only a short white light
      when it is waved. It is more like a trial than a slaughter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299041
    m_Localized: Ashcrown Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299042
    m_Localized: A single-hand sword made of black iron and copper, with a blade
      covered with dark red cracks like molten lava after cooling. The cracks will
      be activated briefly when they are waved, and the sword will be pulled out
      of the tiny Mars. "It burys the remains in the soil and waits for the wind
      to come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299043
    m_Localized: Duskoath Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299044
    m_Localized: "The sword is soaked in the night that the blade does not reflect,
      but leaves only a very short shadow of gray black and black when it is waved.
      The guard is surrounded by a faded oath and a tiny dust dust is sprung between
      the knots.\n\n\u201CDo not ask that you swear, if you remember what you have
      turned away.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299045
    m_Localized: Worn Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299046
    m_Localized: There are a few pieces of daggers that have been used in the past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299047
    m_Localized: Gale Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299048
    m_Localized: 'The blacksmith says this dagger can be cut open.

      He''s just
      a liar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299049
    m_Localized: Volt Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299050
    m_Localized: The blade of the blade, which is sharp and entangles a few currents,
      appears particularly rapid and deadly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299051
    m_Localized: Emberkiss Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299052
    m_Localized: A knife with a blade of a thin edge, with a small chasm of dark
      red, like a fire of carbon, which is cooled. The wound cut by it does not immediately
      hurt, but slowly spreads red red light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299053
    m_Localized: Shadowrend Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299054
    m_Localized: A silver and black dagger with a narrow blade like a firm wind.
      The knife has three tiny blue chips on its back, which leave fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299055
    m_Localized: Coffin Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299056
    m_Localized: The long nails drawn from the black casket are covered with a cold
      wet stun. Each time they enter, they are slowly folded over the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299057
    m_Localized: "\u201CInvincible\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299058
    m_Localized: Man, you're holding your name for your weapon and you're laughing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299059
    m_Localized: Bloodcleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299060
    m_Localized: Ax made of fire and blood, Man's favorite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299061
    m_Localized: Electromagnetic Cleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299062
    m_Localized: 'It''s like welding the mine breakers with the logging axes. It''s
      always a frenzy when it''s thrown.

      "What makes me think it''s manly?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299063
    m_Localized: Searing Griddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299064
    m_Localized: 'A wide-edged axe, which is repeated with black iron and molten
      slag, with the middle of the blade burned through and left a red crack of the
      throat. Each time it is blown, the cracks are browsing and brightening, like
      something breathing inside.


      "The fire doesn''t have to burn. Sometimes
      it just waits for you to cut an exit."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299065
    m_Localized: Lighthunter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299066
    m_Localized: 'The blade is as wide as a worn sun-column, not sharp on its edge,
      but it is made to sway the light into a straight white line when it is waved.
      It is not made to light the darkness, but to catch what is trying to hide behind
      the light.


      "Light will not forgive those who flee. It will only pin
      the shadow to its place."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299067
    m_Localized: Worn Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299068
    m_Localized: Jenny's mother gave it to Jenny, she used it until now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299069
    m_Localized: Frostgleam Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299070
    m_Localized: The rods were filled with ice and air and the magic based on water
      and elements of ice could be applied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299071
    m_Localized: Nighteater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299072
    m_Localized: A staff of black branches that are blindly entangled with fragments
      of stars. When holding them, they hear the whispers of the distant night. It
      does not tear the enemy apart, but turns its fate in a way that falls in the
      darkest place of judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299073
    m_Localized: Bramblebloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299074
    m_Localized: "The staff is made of white vines, with a long-suffering scaffolded
      stump. The edges of the flower petals are light and light, but they are as
      strong as they can be deep down their throats.\n\u201CWhen the flowers have
      reached the end, there is no way back from spring.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
