    m_Localized: A rotten doll, looks like you're on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299391
    m_Localized: Trick Dice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299392
    m_Localized: When an allied skill die rolls its minimum, that ally gains +1 minimum
      die Power next round. Once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299393
    m_Localized: Trash Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299394
    m_Localized: It reeks. How could this possibly be useful?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299395
    m_Localized: Golden Trash Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299396
    m_Localized: At battle start, all allies gain 2 stacks each of Strength, Guard,
      Haste, Luck, and Resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299397
    m_Localized: Dimensional Healing Vial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299398
    m_Localized: After a battle in a special dungeon, all allies recover 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299399
    m_Localized: Potent Venom Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299400
    m_Localized: When an ally loses a clash to a target with Poison, apply 1 stack
      of Poison to that target next round. Once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299401
    m_Localized: It's a triple poison, but it seems a little too much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299402
    m_Localized: "\u201CDisease\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299403
    m_Localized: Targets with Poison deal 10% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299404
    m_Localized: If he is sick, he will be in no way able to make the file sufficiently
      empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299405
    m_Localized: "\u201CPlague\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299406
    m_Localized: When a target with Poison dies, apply the same number of Poison
      stacks to all remaining enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299407
    m_Localized: The horrors were not diseases, but the fear of disease itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299408
    m_Localized: Refined Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299409
    m_Localized: When an enemy reaches 2 stacks of Poison, immediately deal 2 damage
      to it. Once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299410
    m_Localized: The poison is enough. What is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299411
    m_Localized: Priming Dose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299412
    m_Localized: Skill effects that apply Poison on hit apply it on use instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299413
    m_Localized: The best drug in the world, the effects of which have begun to work
      from the moment you saw it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299414
    m_Localized: Chronic Poisoning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299415
    m_Localized: At round end, Poison loses half its stacks, rounded down, instead
      of losing all stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299416
    m_Localized: When a man is no longer in love with a child, it is often long,
      long and long tortured ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299417
    m_Localized: Venom Needle Seal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299418
    m_Localized: At battle start, apply 2 stacks of Poison to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299419
    m_Localized: The man who invented this wax is a bit of a downer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299420
    m_Localized: Bitterroot Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299421
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 maximum die Power when clashing against a target
      with Poison. Once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299422
    m_Localized: The blemish of the medicine, the blemish of the tack sounds good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299423
    m_Localized: Dregs of Medicine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299424
    m_Localized: When a target with Poison dies, heal 1 random injured ally for 3
      HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299425
    m_Localized: The drug which was taken from it, but no one wanted it, so take
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299426
    m_Localized: Venom Sac Charm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299427
    m_Localized: When an enemy with Poison damages an ally, deal damage to that enemy
      equal to its Poison stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299428
    m_Localized: Small pockets of poison that can be carried with them as a last
      resort for defence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299429
    m_Localized: Verdigris Etching Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493312
    m_Localized: Allies deal +1 damage to targets with at least 2 stacks of Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493313
    m_Localized: The use of a knife with poison can cause the poison to be more rapidly
      delivered by severe pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493314
    m_Localized: Pathology Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493315
    m_Localized: Allies deal 20% more damage to targets with Poison, or 40% more
      if the target has at least 3 stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493316
    m_Localized: 'Many known diseases are documented in medical techniques. Similarly,
      known methods of disease exacerbation are documented.

      is this author
      really a normal person?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493317
    m_Localized: Contagion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493318
    m_Localized: When an enemy with Poison wins a clash, apply 1 extra stack of Poison
      to it. Once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493319
    m_Localized: The spread of the disease meant the passing of life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493320
    m_Localized: Bramblebloom Bed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493321
    m_Localized: At round end, if every surviving enemy has Poison, retain at least
      1 stack of Poison for the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493322
    m_Localized: It turns human beings into the most suitable hotbeds for the nourishment
      of disease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493323
    m_Localized: Beyond Cure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493324
    m_Localized: Enemies with Poison cannot heal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493325
    m_Localized: The incorruptible is the greatest compliment of a disease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493326
    m_Localized: Soulcall Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493327
    m_Localized: Once per battle, an ally survives fatal damage by receiving half
      the HP of the ally with the highest HP percentage. If any enemy has at least
      2 stacks of Poison, the rescued ally also gains 1 stack of Strength and 1 of
      Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493328
    m_Localized: The magic medicine that everyone has dreamt of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493329
    m_Localized: Relay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493330
    m_Localized: Shock Bursts consume 50% of Shock stacks instead of all stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493331
    m_Localized: A small device that was repeatedly burned and repeatedly attached,
      with a fratricidal sound of fire in the outer shell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493332
    m_Localized: Solenoid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493333
    m_Localized: Enemy Shock cannot drop below 1 stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493334
    m_Localized: The currents always echo in this short screw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493335
    m_Localized: Conductive Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493336
    m_Localized: "When an ally damages a target with Shock, there is a 10% chance
      to trigger a 1\xD7 Shock Burst without consuming stacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493337
    m_Localized: A knife that cut electricity, magic or technology.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493338
    m_Localized: Electromagnetic Accelerator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493339
    m_Localized: Allies with Shock count as having 1 stack of Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493340
    m_Localized: It makes the body think that the next step has taken place ahead
      of time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493341
    m_Localized: "\u201CSurge Circuit\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493342
    m_Localized: When an ally triggers a Shock Burst on an enemy, deal half the burst
      damage to every other enemy. If there are no other enemies, deal 50% extra
      Shock damage to the target instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493343
    m_Localized: When you knock it, the current returns from the direction it shouldn't
      exist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493344
    m_Localized: Conductive Jumper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493345
    m_Localized: Allies with Shock apply 1 stack of Shock when they damage a target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493346
    m_Localized: It looked like it was out of use, but it could always reconnect
      something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493347
    m_Localized: "\u201CHidden Lightning\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493348
    m_Localized: Allies have a 30% chance to deal 2 extra damage when damaging a
      target with Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493349
    m_Localized: Ray was buried in there, just nobody knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493350
    m_Localized: Faraday Cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493351
    m_Localized: Allies take 10% less damage from attackers with Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493352
    m_Localized: It's safe inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493353
    m_Localized: High-Voltage Spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493354
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 clash Power against targets with Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493355
    m_Localized: A thin platinum thorn, with no blood trough on its surface, but
      only a dense smite of smite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493356
    m_Localized: "\u201CLightning Strike\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493357
    m_Localized: At round end, deal 10 damage to every enemy with at least 10 stacks
      of Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493358
    m_Localized: The electricity that is fuelling is only a sign of the future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493359
    m_Localized: Threshold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493360
    m_Localized: If an ally deals at least 5 Shock Burst damage, next round they
      gain 1 stack of Temporary Strength and apply 2 extra stacks of Shock per attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493361
    m_Localized: You'll soon know what happens when the electricity is above the
      threshold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493362
    m_Localized: Heartguard Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493363
    m_Localized: After pickup, all allies begin the next battle with 10 stacks of
      Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493364
    m_Localized: And when it is placed on its chests, it is heard that the heart
      is beating slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493365
    m_Localized: Cardiac Resonance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493366
    m_Localized: At round start, if all surviving allies have Shock, all allies gain
      1 stack of Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493367
    m_Localized: Every heartbeat is made less lonely and safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493368
    m_Localized: Shock Burst Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493369
    m_Localized: Allies that deal Shock Burst damage gain Shield equal to the damage
      dealt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493370
    m_Localized: It collects the remains of the scattered and re-assembles the injuries
      into a line of defence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493371
    m_Localized: "\u201CMind the Flame\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493372
    m_Localized: When an ally deals Shock Burst damage to a target with Burn, deal
      3 extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493373
    m_Localized: A person is reminded of the incident for the last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493374
    m_Localized: Pacemaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493375
    m_Localized: Once per battle per ally, spend 5 of their Shock stacks to survive
      fatal damage and gain 1 stack of Immunity for this round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493376
    m_Localized: When the heart falls, just one more jump."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493377
    m_Localized: Stocking Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493378
    m_Localized: Shops stock at least 7 items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493379
    m_Localized: With this thin book, the merchants have earned thousands of gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493380
    m_Localized: Energy Insurance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493381
    m_Localized: Losing a clash with a skill that costs Energy refunds 1 Energy.
      Once per skill per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493382
    m_Localized: It is not always the same for the return, at least it will bring
      you back some of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493383
    m_Localized: Driver's License
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493384
    m_Localized: At round start, the slowest ally's Speed becomes equal to that of
      the fastest combatant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493385
    m_Localized: Whose driver's license was stuck in your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493386
    m_Localized: Riposte Spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493387
    m_Localized: When an ally wins a clash with a defense die, they gain 1 stack
      of Temporary Strength next round. Once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493388
    m_Localized: The enemy is a waiter when he hits himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493389
    m_Localized: Shield Spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493390
    m_Localized: At round start, the ally with the lowest HP gains 1 stack of Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493391
    m_Localized: It's a shield. It's a little elf who looks like a shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493392
    m_Localized: "\u201CShield Retort\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493393
    m_Localized: Whenever an ally loses Shield stacks, a random enemy loses the same
      amount of HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493394
    m_Localized: Defense is the best attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493395
    m_Localized: Armor Polish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493396
    m_Localized: At battle start, the ally with the lowest HP gains 2 stacks of Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493397
    m_Localized: The adventurers would put with their hands practical items in their
      bags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493398
    m_Localized: "\u201CA Sense of Safety\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493399
    m_Localized: Allies with Shield gain +1 minimum defense die Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493400
    m_Localized: "Someone needs to be protected \u2014 even if you are protected
      by a blanket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493401
    m_Localized: The Heir's Bequest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493402
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 200 gold, 3 random relics, and 3 random scrolls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493403
    m_Localized: The last wealth of a kingdom that should not be inherited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493404
    m_Localized: Wayfarer's Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493405
    m_Localized: Allows diagonal movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493406
    m_Localized: If the rules are broken, the real God is the one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493407
    m_Localized: Final Farewell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493408
    m_Localized: Lose every companion except your starting character. Recruitment
      is disabled. The party gains +20 max HP. At battle start, allies gain 3 stacks
      of Strength and 3 of Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493409
    m_Localized: I'll never see you again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493410
    m_Localized: Fortune Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493411
    m_Localized: At round start, each surviving ally independently has a 25% chance
      to gain 1 stack of Luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493412
    m_Localized: The magic medicine that many dream of, save it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493413
    m_Localized: Opening Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493414
    m_Localized: The first damage dealt to an enemy each battle is increased by 100%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493415
    m_Localized: Two in cold!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493416
    m_Localized: New World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493417
    m_Localized: Lose all keys. Regenerate all tiles except your current tile and
      the boss tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493418
    m_Localized: Heaven or hell? Only when we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493419
    m_Localized: Yin Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493420
    m_Localized: No battle effect. Reforge it with Yang Fish at a rest tile to receive
      Yin-Yang Fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493421
    m_Localized: Come on, let's go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493422
    m_Localized: Yang Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493423
    m_Localized: No battle effect. Reforge it with Yin Fish at a rest tile to receive
      Yin-Yang Fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493424
    m_Localized: Swim! Come on! Go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493425
    m_Localized: Shattertide Salt Bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493426
    m_Localized: Enemies can no longer gain Erosion. Apply 15 stacks of Vulnerable
      in its place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493427
    m_Localized: The tide had left no traces, but salt had broken the armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493428
    m_Localized: Hidden Reef
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493429
    m_Localized: At round start, apply 1 stack of Slow to each enemy with Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493430
    m_Localized: The water is calm and its feet are not easy to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493431
    m_Localized: Yin-Yang Fish
    m_Metadata:
