  - m_Id: 22781572493541
    m_Localized: The Whispering Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493542
    m_Localized: You were entrusted with the night before the village to visit Guai
      with an echo repairer, who will investigate only a whisper that the living
      will hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493543
    m_Localized: The Doors That Appear Again and Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493544
    m_Localized: "The Heir\u2019s Revenge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493545
    m_Localized: The old castle had a diary of a Crown Prince. You were involved
      in a distorted history and must see the true will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493546
    m_Localized: Labyrinth of Luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493547
    m_Localized: The lucky maze, where rumours came out, was given a great deal of
      rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493548
    m_Localized: Bleed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493549
    m_Localized: When attacked, take damage equal to Bleed stacks, then halve the
      stacks, rounding down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493550
    m_Localized: Burn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493551
    m_Localized: At the start of each round, take damage equal to Burn stacks, then
      halve the stacks, rounding down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
