    m_Localized: Glowing Tree Hollow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493628
    m_Localized: A faint glow draws your eye to a hollow in a dead tree. Peering
      inside, you find pale worms giving off a soft light. What do you do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493629
    m_Localized: Reach Inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493630
    m_Localized: Heal every party member by 20% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493631
    m_Localized: You reach inside. The worms crumble into glowing dust the moment
      you touch them. To your surprise, the wounds on your hand have vanished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493632
    m_Localized: Poke with a Weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493633
    m_Localized: "The party loses 15% HP and gains 2\u20133 common loot items."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493634
    m_Localized: You probe the hollow with your weapon. The worms spray venom and
      scatter. After wiping the poison off, you find a few scraps of loot where they
      had curled up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493635
    m_Localized: Turn around and leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493636
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP. Nothing else happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493637
    m_Localized: You decided not to disturb these little ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493638
    m_Localized: Abandoned Mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493639
    m_Localized: You've encountered a abandoned mine, a steep mine that disappears
      into the dark far away, and you decide...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493640
    m_Localized: Exploiting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493641
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle. Win to receive a special relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493642
    m_Localized: 'You decided to go deep into the mine...

      it was dark, then
      a band, a bunch, and finally it stood before you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493643
    m_Localized: I'll go for a walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493644
    m_Localized: Gain 1 Iron Ore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493645
    m_Localized: You decided to walk on the shallow pits, and the eye-pointed you
      found some iron ore that was not recovered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493646
    m_Localized: I'll go straight away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493647
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493648
    m_Localized: The road ahead is still so far away, it saves some strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493649
    m_Localized: Wandering Bard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493650
    m_Localized: '"You met a poet on the road, who sings and talks with you with
      passion, and after a while he wonders, "Do you want something stressful and
      exciting?"

      You decided...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493651
    m_Localized: Buy it with gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493652
    m_Localized: Pay 10 gold for 1 random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493653
    m_Localized: 'He took out a broken parchment from his clothes after you paid
      him: "Ha ha ha ha!" and then went with a smile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493654
    m_Localized: Food in exchange for him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493655
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493656
    m_Localized: He thanked you and took out a package from his clothes and handed
      it to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493657
    m_Localized: Talking Mushroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493658
    m_Localized: 'When you go on your way, a childish voice sounds everywhere, and
      you look for it for half a day and find it a colored mushroom. Listen to it,
      "Hello, I am a magic mushroom! I can fulfil your wish!"

      You decided...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493659
    m_Localized: Wish for wealth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493660
    m_Localized: "Gain 10\u201320 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493661
    m_Localized: 'You said you wanted a lot of gold.

      I''m just a little mushroom,
      not very rich, but I can give you everything I have! Dig the land under your
      feet!

      you dug up the land beneath your feet and found a pile of gold.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493662
    m_Localized: Wish items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493663
    m_Localized: "Gain 1\u20132 pieces of Poison loot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493664
    m_Localized: 'You said you wanted some booty.

      "In the trees! In the trees!"

      You
      climbed up a tree,'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493665
    m_Localized: Wish for a few more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493666
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493667
    m_Localized: "You said you wanted a few more wishes.\n\"Well, I don't have so
      much magic...\"\nthe mushrooms say so.\n\"But I can try for you!\"\nit was
      a little shaken and seemed so hard.\nthe color of the color is disappearing.\n\u201C\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u201D\nit's
      not moving, it's gone.\nYou got nothing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493668
    m_Localized: Floating Soul Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493669
    m_Localized: 'You noticed something floating in the air.

      when you look
      at it, you find a semi-transparent object, and when you look at it, it talks:
      "What are you looking at, have you seen the soul?"

      You asked how it
      got like this.

      I''m here because I''m here." I said, "You''re here to
      overdo me."

      You decided...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493670
    m_Localized: I'm a soul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493671
    m_Localized: The party gains 10 XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493672
    m_Localized: '"Oh, I''m free at last..."

      You''ve outdone your soul. You
      feel like you''ve been promoted.

      your team has 10 years of experience.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493673
    m_Localized: Absorb the soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493674
    m_Localized: Gain a special relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493675
    m_Localized: '"What are you doing? No!

      the sound of the soul is getting
      smaller and smaller until you have absorbed it completely.

      You feel
      your soul mixed with it.

      You''re all one together.

      is that a
      good thing?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493676
    m_Localized: Turn around and leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493677
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493678
    m_Localized: 'You let that irrational soul shout

      You turned around and
      left here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493679
    m_Localized: Little Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493680
    m_Localized: The cat on the side of the road suddenly sang at you, you decide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493681
    m_Localized: Fed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493682
    m_Localized: ???
