    m_Localized: The cat attacked you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493687
    m_Localized: Go on, scream at him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493688
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493689
    m_Localized: 'You seem to have established some kind of communication, which
      makes you a kind of person?

      You''ve got some pussy savings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493690
    m_Localized: Frenzied Rat Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493691
    m_Localized: You have been caught by a vortex of rodents, and the rodents have
      come to you, and you have decided at this critical moment...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493692
    m_Localized: Heads up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493693
    m_Localized: Enter a battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493694
    m_Localized: You decided to fight with your head on your head, hoping to be bitten
      by rodents...
