    m_Localized: You dropped the food in your backpack with a wit and left here safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493698
    m_Localized: The Emperor is hiding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493699
    m_Localized: The party loses 20% of max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493700
    m_Localized: You ran around without any rules, and, while eventually barely avoided
      the ending of being white bones, you were bitten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493701
    m_Localized: Spike Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493702
    m_Localized: 'The earth beneath your feet fell down, and when the cover of the
      earth was removed, a row of thorns filled with cold light appeared to you from
      beneath it.

      You are in a hurry at this time of need...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493703
    m_Localized: Jump quickly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493704
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493705
    m_Localized: Your flexible and swift response has saved you from danger, but
      your heart is still beating so hard that you can't return to God for a long
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493706
    m_Localized: Take the rock off the wall and wash it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493707
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and 20% party HP. Gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493708
    m_Localized: Your flexible and swift response has saved you from danger, but
      your heart is still beating so hard that you can't return to God for a long
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493709
    m_Localized: Roadside Clay Jar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493710
    m_Localized: There were old pottery cans on the road that were buried in the
      soil, and the cans were soaking in light gold, like what was hidden in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493711
    m_Localized: I'll break it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493712
    m_Localized: "Gain 8\u201316 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493713
    m_Localized: You cut open the pot of pottery, and there were gold in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493714
    m_Localized: I'll take it out carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493715
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and gain a random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493716
    m_Localized: You carefully dig out the pot of china and then pull out what is
      inside and find out there is a weapon drawing. You put it away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493717
    m_Localized: Dig deeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493718
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain a random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493719
    m_Localized: And you found a thing buried beneath the earth, while you were digging
      unstintingly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493720
    m_Localized: Signpost by the Sea
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493721
    m_Localized: The crooked sign had a vague hysteria and some blood? It seemed
      to point in different directions, and one of the roads was marked by a blunder
      of foot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493722
    m_Localized: We're going on the road we're not stepping on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493723
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493724
    m_Localized: You go along the road that no one has stepped on, and you go too
      far in silence. But when you leave the coast, it is like you are in another
      world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493725
    m_Localized: We'll follow the trail of the foot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493726
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493727
    m_Localized: 'Be quiet, it''s too quiet.

      The quiet air is wrapped around
      you.

      there is something watching you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493728
    m_Localized: Take down the wooden card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493729
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493730
    m_Localized: 'You take down the wooden card, and whatever is a fool is in your
      way.

      When you unwrite the wooden, you hear the groaning of the waves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493731
    m_Localized: Treasure Chest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493732
    m_Localized: '"The treasure box is the best one."

      when you see a treasure
      box on the side of the road, you carry...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493733
    m_Localized: I'm surprised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493734
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493735
    m_Localized: "\u201CO you who are hopeful and optimistic, your life is destined
      to be successful and full of hope.\u201D\na little note in the box is written.\nthere
      was a silver silver coin with a bright flash."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493736
    m_Localized: Wonders of the mood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493737
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493738
    m_Localized: '"O you who are curious and seek to know, your life will not be
      as long as you expect. You may be satisfied with the end of the journey."

      a
      little note in the box is written.

      there was a silver silver coin with
      a bright flash.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493739
    m_Localized: I'm so upset.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493740
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493741
    m_Localized: "There is no need to panic. The good things of the world are always
      there. If you are still not sure whether the road is difficult or whether there
      is a back road, look up. The world is so big that it is always your peace.\u201D\na
      little note in the box is written.\nthere was a silver silver coin with a bright
      flash."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493742
    m_Localized: Broken Bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493743
    m_Localized: The old bridge was above the canyon, and the board was already one
      third short. The wind drilled through the cracks, the wood squeezed and the
      sound of it was dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493744
    m_Localized: Quick pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493745
    m_Localized: The party loses 10% HP. Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493746
    m_Localized: When you entered the bridge, the groan of the ridges, the groan
      of the ridges, the creak of the ridges, the plank of the foot, which you were
      about to reach the other side, suddenly burst and you seized the rope on both
      sides of the platter. In the end, you reached the other side in a state of
      fear, though you cut many wounds from the rough ropes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493747
    m_Localized: A long way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493748
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and heal the party by 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493749
    m_Localized: Although it took a great deal of time, the feeling of being on the
      ground reassured everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493750
    m_Localized: Fix the bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493751
    m_Localized: "Lose 2 AP and gain 25\u201335 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493752
    m_Localized: 'You decided to fix this rocking bridge.

      After a hard time,
      a solid new bridge was established in the middle of the canyon, and you noded
      your place.

      I was surprised to see you through the new bridge, which
      they were a business team who were often walking along, which was in the way
      of valuable goods, and which they could not accept any loss of goods after
      the bridge, so they had to go all the way. Today, when someone had fixed the
      bridge, it was very grateful, so they put some gold and goods in it and wished
      you a smooth journey.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493753
    m_Localized: The Whispering Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493754
    m_Localized: 'You arrived in a village that was about to be flooded by a reservoir.
      The villagers were moving the last wooden boxes, while a young woman remained
      behind.


      The village chief said that he was Lin Ji, the daughter of
      Lin Shui. She was going to whisper tonight to confirm the legends mentioned
      in his father''s belongings before the well was sealed.


      there are so
      many noises on the well. The mayor wants you to accompany her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493755
    m_Localized: I'll go with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493756
    m_Localized: Lose 5 AP and enter the Whispering Well dungeon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493757
    m_Localized: 'Lin was carrying a sealed wooden box.


      I''m an echo repairer,
      just to make sure that the legend is true. If something comes near, buy me
      time."


      she opened the box with a gray white echo snail, three sonic
      needles, a sealed sonic wax and several blank bells with a small stun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493758
    m_Localized: I don't care.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493759
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493760
    m_Localized: I'm responsible for my own problems.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493761
    m_Localized: Memories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493762
    m_Localized: A Request at the Village Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493763
    m_Localized: 'When you arrived in the village, the village was moving the last
      boxes. The reservoir will be flooded tomorrow and the village will be closed
      after tonight.


      The village chief stopped you, pointing at the young
      woman in front of the temple.


      She''s going to whisper tonight. There''s
      a lot of noise on the well. Can you accompany her?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493764
    m_Localized: I'll go with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493765
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493766
    m_Localized: 'Lin Jian, who heard the village chief, came with a sealed wooden
      box.


      I''m an echo repairer, just to make sure that the legend is true.
      If something comes near, buy me time."


      she opened the box with a gray
      white echo snail, three sonic needles, a sealed sonic wax and several blank
      bells with a small stun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493767
    m_Localized: Lin Zhi's Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493768
    m_Localized: 'Lin is taking out a blank shellfish and showing you the stow.


      The
      echo snails hold the sound of the human voice. The bells leave a line. As long
      as the whispering well is really sound, it should be able to be taken off."


      She
      said that her father had just died and that there was a note in the remains,
      which referred repeatedly to the whisper well.


      "He never told me why
      her mother disappeared. The well will be sealed tonight and I will not wait."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493769
    m_Localized: Go to the temple with her to pick up her notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493770
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493771
    m_Localized: 'The door of the temple is not locked. The old wooden box with the
      wood of the forest is placed next to the table and there are fresh marks of
      water on the top of the box.


      He was down and opened the wooden box
      and took out a tidal note.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493772
    m_Localized: Father's Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493773
    m_Localized: 'The notes are placed on the table. The first pages record the water
      level, the amount of rain, the position of the cracks in the well, and the
      rest of the contents are shorter.


      many pages have the same words:


      "Don''t
      let her listen to the well."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493774
    m_Localized: Keep looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493775
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493776
    m_Localized: "On the last pages, you find Xu Yin's name written over and over.
      Lin Huai underlined every occurrence. Beside a few, he wrote \u201CI remembered
      today\u201D and \u201CDon't forget.\u201D\n\n\u201CXu Yin was my mother,\u201D
      says Lin Zhi, staring at the notes. \u201CThe village says she followed a voice
      into the well eighteen years ago. My father never let me ask about her.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493777
    m_Localized: Legend of the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493778
    m_Localized: 'Lin''s notes will be kept, and the legend will be explained to
      you.


      When the night is close to the well, the last words of the dead
      will be heard. But every time they hear, they lose a memory of that person.


      She
      was pulling a sealed wooden box.


      "That''s why I have to shut up with
      an echo. As long as the sound goes into the screw, it doesn''t have to be exchanged
      for the memory of the human being."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493779
    m_Localized: Go to the well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493780
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493781
    m_Localized: When you left the temple, the lights were half out at the village
      entrance. The path to the ancient well passed through the old fields, the ground
      was wet and there were drag marks in the grass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493782
    m_Localized: Shen Shuang, Keeper of the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493783
    m_Localized: "She was sitting with a white-haired old man. Lin called her grandma.\n\nHe
      saw you come with a closed wooden box, nod your heads and look at the wood.\n\n\u201CI
      cannot stop you. But you know, the whisper well does not leave the sound to
      the screw, nor the shell. It only makes the living hear.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493784
    m_Localized: I'll put a silence on Lin Yu's table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493785
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493786
    m_Localized: 'You put three pins on the outside of the well. Lin puts an echo
      snail in the heart and presses it with a seal wax.


      The echoed snail
      surface spreads a thin circle of light.


      He said, "If you hear anyone,
      you forget about him. Not immediately, but a piece less."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493787
    m_Localized: Shen Shuang's Warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493788
    m_Localized: 'Lin said to Shen Shuk, "My father heard about it too?"


      She
      didn''t answer immediately. She looked at the well along the rusty bell.


      "He
      heard it many times. More then, I''m not sure he remembers why he came."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493789
    m_Localized: By midnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493790
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493791
    m_Localized: 'After having checked the tone of the tone during midnight, you
      will be assured that the seal wax is not broken.


      there is no sound
      of water beneath the well. Only the wind goes up from the well wall.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493792
    m_Localized: The First Voice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493793
    m_Localized: 'After midnight, the echo snail did not shine.


      the man is
      about to adjust the pin, and she stops; she looks up to you and looks to the
      well.


      the sound of a woman from the bottom of the well.


      "Ok,
      don''t blame your father."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493794
    m_Localized: View echo snail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493795
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493796
    m_Localized: 'You take the echo. The shell is cold, and there is only a normal
      wind in it.


      there is no sound on the blank shell.


      Lin said
      that it was the voice of her mother, Xuin. She did not ask you to believe,
      but to write it to the hand of the notes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493797
    m_Localized: A Voice That Won't Stay Sealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493798
    m_Localized: 'She tried again. She put the echo snails closer to the well.


      The
      bottom of the well is silent. The shell is still blank.


      He said, "The
      well has taken its first share."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493799
    m_Localized: What did you take?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493800
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493801
    m_Localized: 'She stopped at the door when she went back to the village.


      She
      remembers that her mother had cooked her a meal here, and she sits at the threshold,
      but she can''t remember the name or taste of the dish.


      She put her
      hand on the stove and said, "The legend is true."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493802
    m_Localized: The Second Whisper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493803
    m_Localized: "Lin was not able to leave immediately. She asked you to listen
      to her again.\n\n\u201CIf my mother really left behind, I would at least know
      why she disappeared.\u201D\n\nShe is near the well's stairwell. You hold the
      sound bar and prevent the wind from blowing the pin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493804
    m_Localized: We'll stay by the well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493805
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493806
    m_Localized: 'A second sentence from the well.


      "I didn''t leave that
      night."


      Lin Jian wrote this. When she wrote it, she asked you, "Did
      I just say that my mother smile well?"


      She said she remembered that
      but could not remember what it was when her mother laughed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493807
    m_Localized: The Third Whisper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493808
    m_Localized: 'Lin wanted to continue. Shen san grabbed her wrist.


      "Hear
      more and you''ll be looking for fewer and fewer."


      Lin was not throwing
      out Shen Shuk. She just asked, "Why does my father keep listening?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493809
    m_Localized: I'll answer her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493810
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493811
    m_Localized: "Shen Shuang glances at you, as if making sure someone can still
      bring Lin Zhi home.\n\n\u201CBecause eighteen years ago, Lin Huai was the one
      who heard the last words.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493812
    m_Localized: The Night of the Flood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493813
    m_Localized: 'The iron bell beside the well still sways after the fight.


      Shen
      Shuang says the flood came fast eighteen years ago. Xu Yin heard the mountain
      crack first. She ran to the well and rang the bell to wake the village.


      The
      villagers escaped. Xu Yin was trapped under the well when the ground collapsed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493814
    m_Localized: I'll finish listening to her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493815
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493816
    m_Localized: "When the lin came to them, the wall of the well fell down. The
      rain and the mud poured into the well, and he was only lying on the well's
      supplant, crying out for Xu\u2019in\u2019s name.\n\nHe said:\n\n\"Don't let
      the Xiang remember that I died in such pain.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493817
    m_Localized: Why Lin Huai Stayed Silent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493818
    m_Localized: 'She said that the whispering well left the last sentence of Xu
      Yin, which also turned into the last thing Lin Yuen would do for life.


      He
      came to hear the wells once and again and exchanged his memory for the sound
      left by Xu Yin.

      He wondered whether her daughter had grown well and
      what she should be told and what pain should not be told too early.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493819
    m_Localized: I'll read Lin's notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493820
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493821
    m_Localized: 'Lin''s pens opened up.


      the name that you read is written
      in a few smaller lines:


      "Forget her singing today."

      "I can''t
      remember her wedding dress today."

      "To remember her name today."

      "Don''t
      let the listening wells."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493822
    m_Localized: What Father Left Blank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493823
    m_Localized: "Lin was looking at him for a long time and did not ask him why
      he was silent.\n\nShe understood that Lin was not refusing to speak of Xiao
      Yin. He had replaced all the answers he could give to her daughter and left
      everything behind.\n\nHe said, \u201CHe was not sure about Xu Yin's voice,
      but he remembered that he couldn't let you hear it.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493824
    m_Localized: I'll go back to the well with Lin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493825
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493826
    m_Localized: The last night before the well is closed. The construction team
      will seal the well in the morning and the reservoir will sink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493827
    m_Localized: The Last Night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493828
    m_Localized: 'Lin was standing by the well and there was no more silence.


      If
      I hear it again, I may forget more about my mother. But if my father left a
      message, should I listen?


      She was not chosen by her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493829
    m_Localized: Stay with her by the well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493830
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493831
    m_Localized: 'The sound of Xu Yin is not from the well.


      Lin.


      "Ping,
      my father didn''t raise you well, but I tried hard to hurt you."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493832
    m_Localized: Asking for No More Voices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493833
    m_Localized: 'Lin was crouched by the well and had not spoken for a long time.


      She
      then put in his notes, the mother''s hairpin and the echo snail that could
      not hold the sound of the well.


      She said, "No need to say it again.
      I heard you."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493834
    m_Localized: Leave the well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493835
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493836
    m_Localized: 'The reservoirs were flooded the next day. The low wells were covered
      in water.


      she was asked what her father was. She thought about it and
      said:


      "He was a very light voice," she said.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493837
    m_Localized: Wrecked Carriage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493838
    m_Localized: A broken carriage car was trapped in mud, the door was open and
      there were boxes full of water. Strangely, the space seemed bigger than the
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493839
    m_Localized: Search the baggage shelves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493840
    m_Localized: "Gain 10\u201318 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493841
    m_Localized: You found some gold on the luggage shelf, who would leave his luggage
      and gold in the car?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493842
    m_Localized: Open the locked container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493843
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493844
    m_Localized: You've had a lot of trouble breaking into a less heavy container
      that looks soaked, and hope that something in it will be useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493845
    m_Localized: Go to the deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493846
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493847
    m_Localized: 'The space is clearly distorted and completely unsound.

      You
      decided to look deep.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493848
    m_Localized: Rusted Altar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493849
    m_Localized: A rusty altar is blocked in the middle of the road. There is a dent
      in the center of the altar, shaped like a material placed down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493850
    m_Localized: I'll give you a prize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493851
    m_Localized: Lose 1 random loot item and gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493852
    m_Localized: The altar was made to feel what you had given, and the light of
      the light of the light, and the spoils of the war which you had placed were
      turned into a thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493853
    m_Localized: Break the altar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493854
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and gain 2 random loot items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493855
    m_Localized: 'You broke the altar. It doesn''t look good.

      You found that
      the altar which you broke hidden under a table which was given to them, something
      which seemed to be given by others.

      You took them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493856
    m_Localized: Reflection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493857
    m_Localized: "There is a shallow water low on the road, but the heat of the weather
      should not have water, and curiosity has driven you to look at it.\nthere is
      nothing but a plain pile of water, and when you leave you suddenly realize
      a strange thing \u2014 you have nothing in the mirror.\nI'll just... I'll be
      watching you from the water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493858
    m_Localized: I'll take a step in the mirror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493859
    m_Localized: Enter a special battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493860
    m_Localized: 'You had a big bump on the back, and you couldn''t see the water,
      and the water was sprouting everywhere.

      You will not see it until the
      silence settles.

      there is no one there.

      You look up and you find
      the reflection inside and you''re standing in front of you for some time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493861
    m_Localized: Have a drink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493862
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to do this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493863
    m_Localized: 'You drank a drop of water from this little pool and found an unusual
      sweet taste.

      Then look into the water and find that the images of the
      people inside have disappeared.

      I don''t care. You just want to drink
      a few more now.

      You''re feeling full of life now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493864
    m_Localized: We'll take the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493865
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493866
    m_Localized: He's not gonna come after you if you don't mess with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493867
    m_Localized: Mystery Box Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493868
    m_Localized: 'A stand without signs was on the road and the vendors had all their
      cargo in boxes, which seemed to be blind boxes.

      "Want to buy a blind
      box when you pass by?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493869
    m_Localized: Pick the smallest package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493870
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493871
    m_Localized: 'The businessman smiled and handed you a small package, which you
      opened and found some gold in it.

      "Wow, it''s gold! I don''t know how
      much is in there, I''ll tell you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493872
    m_Localized: We'll pick the most heavy package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493873
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493874
    m_Localized: '"Good view, guest, though I don''t know what''s inside."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493875
    m_Localized: Pick the biggest package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493876
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493877
    m_Localized: '"Look what''s inside."

      You opened the package and found
      another one in it.

      You got a package, maybe called a package.

      package?

      package?

      package?

      When
      you think about it, the businessman has run away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493878
    m_Localized: I'll go without buying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493879
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493880
    m_Localized: "\u201CTsk.\u201D\nThe merchant clicks his tongue. Is he going to
      attack you? In broad daylight? Is he going to make you buy something?\nYou
      watch him warily. He only swatted a mosquito.\n\u201CWhat a shame. Maybe next
      time, friend!\u201D\nToo bad. If he'd forced the sale, you could have filed
      a complaint for ten times the price."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493881
    m_Localized: Unclaimed Letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493882
    m_Localized: A letter containing the waxed blood red was inserted in the gap
      of the sign. There was no signature on the envelope, but it said, "Please don't
      open it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493883
    m_Localized: Open Message
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493884
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493885
    m_Localized: 'You opened the letter with unknown symbols that were twisted and
      twisted, which seemed to be still vibrating as if there was life.

      And
      they become red and sharp, and a strong feeling of discomfort pours into your
      heart, and you fail to hold firm, and faith falls from your fingers to the
      ground.

      the moment your fingers left the paper, your discomfort disappeared.

      You
      decided not to pick it up again.

      In the trance, you feel some dark knowledge
      slip into your brain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493886
    m_Localized: Ignored the letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493887
    m_Localized: Recover 1 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493888
    m_Localized: If you don't open it, you won't open it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493889
    m_Localized: Burn the message
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493890
    m_Localized: The party gains 5 XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493891
    m_Localized: 'You decided to burn the letter, and this unknown thing was made
      of some kind of black magic or evil.

      You burn it now and maybe save
      the people who want to see it.

      With this anonymous letter turned to
      ashes, you felt that your soul had some kind of elevate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493892
    m_Localized: Leaning Bell Tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687616
    m_Localized: 'A small bell tower leans on the hillside.

      The clock was
      also moving softly without wind, and every sound made you feel a little less
      time.

      The clock was about to be ringing, but it seemed that the tower
      was completely unattended.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687617
    m_Localized: The bells.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687618
    m_Localized: Fully restore AP and enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687619
    m_Localized: 'You''re ringing the big clock.

      the Quran,

      It seems
      that the only bell in the sky and the earth will ring.

      The bell attracted
      some hostile creatures.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687620
    m_Localized: Let's move it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687621
    m_Localized: Recover 4 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687622
    m_Localized: 'It is more urgent to feel the passage of time.

      You decided
      to move on with your team.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687623
    m_Localized: Take a break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687624
    m_Localized: Heal the party by 20% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687625
    m_Localized: Why rush? It is the need for a strong spirit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687626
    m_Localized: Extinguished Campfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687627
    m_Localized: 'A bunch of campfires just went out were on the road and were smoking
      silk.

      there is something left behind or abandoned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687628
    m_Localized: Take a break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687629
    m_Localized: Recover 3 AP and heal the party by 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687630
    m_Localized: 'You set fire to the camp and rest while seeing if the owner of
      the camp would come back to pick up the items.

      after a night off, no
      one came back.

      You decided to go straight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687631
    m_Localized: Get some stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687632
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687633
    m_Localized: 'The owner is probably not back, and in that case, the things here
      are empty.

      you don''t mind giving the orphan a place to belong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687634
    m_Localized: Tangled Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687635
    m_Localized: A broken puppet hanging on a branch and stung by a rope that looked
      like a hanger. The line on the puppet went deep into the forest. Its head was
      low, like someone was helping it untangled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687636
    m_Localized: Untie it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687637
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random uncommon loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687638
    m_Localized: 'You climbed up a tree and you had the hard time undrawling the
      rope around the puppet''s neck.

      When you untie the rope, the wood idols
      were given life and they were given to break your hand and then jumped to the
      ground and fell to pieces.

      Sometimes excessive freedom is self-destructed.

      You
      sighed and picked up a shiny object in the puppet body.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687639
    m_Localized: Trace the thread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687640
    m_Localized: Enter an extremely difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687641
    m_Localized: 'You decided to see who was doing it.

      As you enter the forest,
      you find that the wires are more and more dense and that the puppets are all
      over the place, as if there was a master at the heart of the net.

      "There''s
      another hook in the prey."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687642
    m_Localized: Medical Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687643
    m_Localized: "A white medical box was placed on a rock, the micro-boiling of
      the box cap was opened and the bandages were not as neat as they had been used.\n\u201C30
      gold once, not on credit.\u201D The next sign says.\nthere is no doctor here,
      or there is no doctor here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687644
    m_Localized: Treatment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687645
    m_Localized: Heal the party by 50% of max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687646
    m_Localized: 'You pay for the bandages and the medical equipment that floated
      up and started to patch you up.

      In a while, your wounds will be almost
      intact.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687647
    m_Localized: Take the gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687648
    m_Localized: The party loses 30% HP. Gain 50 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687649
    m_Localized: 'You decided to take gold from someone else who was not here to
      watch.

      When you put the gold on the stone in a bag, the medical case
      slowly floated out a knife and then stuck it so severely on your ass.

      "Ow!

      You
      ran from the desert, better because you got the gold.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687650
    m_Localized: I'm going straight away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687651
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687652
    m_Localized: You don't need treatment, so keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687653
    m_Localized: Light Between the Stones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687654
    m_Localized: 'You are crossing a narrow sew.

      There''s a light coming out
      of the cracks of the rock, like a light lit in the rock.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687655
    m_Localized: Crawl it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687656
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain 1 random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687657
    m_Localized: 'You cut the rock walls and found inside it a collection of books.

      The
      dust was covered with the floor and the table, but the eye-pointed you found
      a valuable scroll on the table.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687658
    m_Localized: I'm going straight away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687659
    m_Localized: Recover 1 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687660
    m_Localized: Curiosity killed the cat, but it was important to hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687661
    m_Localized: Fire!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687662
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687663
    m_Localized: 'You lit a fire that reached the gap, and the spark that was supposed
      to spill lit the whole space, and the fire burned the next room clean.

      When
      the fire was over, you noticed that something that looked valuable was visible
      in the place where the touch was available.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687664
    m_Localized: Old Gambling Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687665
    m_Localized: There is a table in the middle of the empty land, with three cups
      of glass on it, in reverse. There is no house, but the cup moves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687666
    m_Localized: A little gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687667
    m_Localized: "Gain 0\u201320 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687668
    m_Localized: 'Little bet, big bet, big bet.

      a little bet, and then the
      laugh is over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687669
    m_Localized: Big bet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687670
    m_Localized: "Gain 0\u201366 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687671
    m_Localized: You earn gold for this moment!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687672
    m_Localized: Don't go to the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687673
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687674
    m_Localized: 'You resist the temptation.

      The odds favor the house. Walking
      away is its own win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687675
    m_Localized: Old Gambling Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687676
    m_Localized: When you open the cup, count the gold and decide...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687677
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687678
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687679
    m_Localized: It's good for you, but let's keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687680
    m_Localized: I'll take over the tables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687681
    m_Localized: Gain 66 gold and enter a special battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687682
    m_Localized: 'Fuck you! They''re out of gold!

      You were very upset with
      the amount of gold you had, and the anger made you roll all the gold on the
      table and turn their court.

      there is nothing under the table but a pair
      of eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687683
    m_Localized: The Recurring Door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687684
    m_Localized: You have seen this door for the third time. It has no walls, no
      rooms, and it stands in the middle of the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687685
    m_Localized: Open the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687686
    m_Localized: Enter a special dungeon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687687
    m_Localized: 'You pushed the door, there was a narrow passage.

      there''s
      a same door at the end of the passage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687688
    m_Localized: Go around the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687689
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687690
    m_Localized: 'You''re going to bypass this door again.

      it has given up
      to appear before you and you have never seen it again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687691
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687692
    m_Localized: 'The gamblers at the side of the road called you, "Do you want to
      try your luck?"

      When he''s been cutting three broken bowls in one word,
      you decide:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687693
    m_Localized: I want to try!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687694
    m_Localized: Choose one of three bowls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687695
    m_Localized: 'The gamblers laugh: "win or lose!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687696
    m_Localized: No, no, no.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687697
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687698
    m_Localized: 'You will be cast away, and gamblers will curse with disappointment:
      "You coward, you will lose!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687699
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687700
    m_Localized: He didn't fool you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687701
    m_Localized: Let's move on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687702
    m_Localized: Three Trash Bags automatically combine into a Golden Trash Bag with
      a much larger bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687703
    m_Localized: He didn't fool you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687704
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687705
    m_Localized: 'The gamblers pushed three old bowls into your face.


      choose,
      don''t regret it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687706
    m_Localized: I'll pick the bowl on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687707
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687708
    m_Localized: 'Gain the Trash Bag relic.

      Your subsequent equipment fusions
      have a 50% chance to create a Trash Bag.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687709
    m_Localized: '"I didn''t think you were worse off than me. Thank you for 30 gold."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687710
    m_Localized: "Lose all gold, then regain 50\u2013150% of your original amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687711
    m_Localized: '"How''s your luck?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687712
    m_Localized: Reforge 3 random relics in your inventory into relics of the same
      rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687713
    m_Localized: '"It''s not cheap?"'
