  - m_Id: 22781576687790
    m_Localized: The Heir's Legacy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687791
    m_Localized: 'The thick wooden door was pierced by a violent hole and a rotting
      wooden card was placed on the land at the front of the door, most of which
      was worn out by the wind and only one word left:


      "Get everything from
      me..."


      The castle seemed to be so drawn from its depths that someone
      was waiting for a response after a long period of time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687792
    m_Localized: I feel it. Go inside and see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687793
    m_Localized: Lose 5 AP and enter The Heir's Revenge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687794
    m_Localized: 'You crossed the broken gates of the castle, where it was cold and
      wet. There was only a lean table of wood, on which half a rotten note was put.


      The
      note reads: "Will you inherit everything from him?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687795
    m_Localized: I don't think so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687796
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687797
    m_Localized: 'You look inside the dark castle, you turn around and walk away.


      when
      you turn around, you are smouldered by a dark wind, like something staring
      at you. Look back, the door is empty and empty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687798
    m_Localized: The Steward's Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687799
    m_Localized: 'You entered the gates of the castle, and suddenly you saw a flower.


      an
      old man in black is standing in the middle of the hall. He has a flat face
      and eyes and sounds like he''s in the wall: "You also desire the legacy of
      my master?"


      when you say you are coming for the wooden card at the
      door, the old man laughs, "No hiding from his greed, good. If my lord wills,
      he will inherit everything."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687800
    m_Localized: I do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687801
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687802
    m_Localized: 'The old man had a small head, and the face of the man was so scoffed
      by the wind that he could not see the look.


      "Okay, come with me."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687803
    m_Localized: The Heir's Last Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687804
    m_Localized: 'You follow the old black people to the deep of the castle. The
      corridor is dark and the dark wind blows through the windows, and the sound
      and weeping sign spins around the stone wall.


      You heard a lot of mixed
      voices: a low groan, a squealing scream, a strange laugh, a grunt roar. They
      were like talking about something, but you couldn''t hear a word.


      The
      old man stopped and turned and said, "What did you hear?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687805
    m_Localized: I heard many voices but I didn't hear anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687806
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687807
    m_Localized: 'You speak the truth. The old nod silently and bring you to a stone
      door.


      There was a deep wound of sword on the stone door, with a large
      stain of brown, like dried blood.


      "This is my lord''s secret room,
      where he is hidden. There is his diary on the table. Read it and finish his
      last wish, and I will pay you. Don''t be smart. I''ll always look at you."


      You
      open the stone door and pick up a book of dust on the desk. You have just turned
      the first page, and a great suction has come out of the pages, and you are
      drawn into the diary without fear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687808
    m_Localized: The Heir's Past
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687809
    m_Localized: 'You fell on the smooth marble floor. Look up and stand in a glorious
      palace.


      The crowned king smiled at the two princes kneeling on one
      knee. The prince on the left side was wearing a coat of armor, holding the
      head of the enemy and giving his service to the king.


      The old man,
      who stood by you at any time, whispered, "That is my lord. The first king made
      him the Crown Prince. Then the nation decided that he would be king of the
      future."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687810
    m_Localized: But he's not the king of the future, is he?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687811
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687812
    m_Localized: "The old nod with cold faces. The picture turned and the palace
      disappeared and replaced it with a narrow canyon.\n\nThe young prince's silver
      helmet was bloodied with a blade deep in the king's chest. The king was breathless
      and his empty eyes were staring at him.\n\nThe voice of the old man ran out
      in the canyon: \u201CAfter the invasion of the enemy, the king's army came
      to the front and was attacked in the canyon. The fellow soldiers testify that
      my master collaborated with the enemy and killed the first king by the rebels.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687813
    m_Localized: A Prince's Betrayal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687814
    m_Localized: 'The Crown Prince was surrounded by a group of men, and people were
      crying out for the traitors to be killed and avenged the king.


      when
      you look at the eyes of the old man, he thrusts you from behind his back. Next
      moment, you stand by the Crown Prince, and all the angry eyes fall upon you.


      The
      voice of the old echoed in the canyon: "Protect my lord from the palace. Otherwise,
      you will not have his inheritance."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687815
    m_Localized: I will protect the Crown Prince and return to the palace!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687816
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687817
    m_Localized: 'You hold the sword firmly between the Crown Prince and the pursuit
      of men.


      The princes of the princes were gathered together. You must
      kill a path of blood and take him from the valley.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687818
    m_Localized: The Final Verdict
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687819
    m_Localized: "You and the prince's prowess killed the canyon and escorted the
      wounded prince back to the palace.\n\nthe Second Prince has been waiting for
      the army there.\n\nHe looked at the Crown Prince with cold eyes, and he made
      you a traitor. Today I will clean the door for him.\"\n\nThe Crown Prince was
      forced to go to the stone gate, and his hands were broken and his sword was
      shaken: \u201CI am not a traitor. Do not listen to the words of the little
      man.\u201D\n\n\"The princes will rise to the sword and crucify the prince on
      the stone door.\" Blood will spill and the prince will be on his face. \"You
      will regret...\"\n\nThe words were heard, the two princes drew their swords
      and cut off the head of the Crown Prince.\n\n\"This is the regret of my master.
      Answer me, did he betray the country?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687820
    m_Localized: He betrayed his country. He deserved to die!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687821
    m_Localized: Enter a desperate battle and end the event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687822
    m_Localized: 'There is no hesitation in your answer. The old ones are silent
      and laugh at the sky.


      "I thought you could see the truth, and I thought
      you had eyes too. Heavenly, heavenly!"


      He was a blooded prince, a blooded
      prince, and a blood-stained armor, with a blood-stained sword on his head.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687823
    m_Localized: I don't think there's anything wrong with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687824
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687825
    m_Localized: 'The old man is silent for a moment: "Tell me."


      "The army
      that surrounds the Crown Prince wears green headscarf, the army that fought
      with the king without the headscarf. The men who wear the green headscarf are
      supposed to be the servants of the two princes."


      The old laughed, "Yes,
      they are rebels. Before my master went to rescue him, they killed the king
      and accused him of the crime."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687826
    m_Localized: The True Last Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687827
    m_Localized: "The old man's eyes were bright and bright.\n\n\"Go on, watch.\"\n\nHe
      raised his hand dry and changed the scenes. The two princes sat at the table
      and put the diary on the table. A middle-aged man fell before him and smiled.\n\nThe
      kingdom will be scolded by the former Crown Prince, Your Highness. You will
      be officially heir to the throne tomorrow, and do not forget the grace of the
      little man.\u201D\n\nThe prince smiled: \"Natural. But before that, you must
      do me one last favor.\"\n\nThe middle-aged nobles were busy noding: \u201CYour
      Highness commands.\u201D\n\nThe two princes extended their hands: \"Keep our
      secrets.\"\n\nHe was cut from the back of the nobles and cast a shadow from
      the floor. The two princes cast down the diary and went out of the secret room:
      \"Only the dead will keep secrets. Seal the door, especially my brother's diary.
      If they cannot touch their fingers, let no one get them.\"\n\nthe old man took
      a slap on your shoulder: \"Tell me what my master wishes for.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687828
    m_Localized: Avenge the first king and kill the two princes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687829
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687830
    m_Localized: 'The elderly satisfied with the location.


      "Go, you will
      find him in front of the temple, and kill him and avenge my lord and my king."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687831
    m_Localized: Fulfill the Last Wish?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687832
    m_Localized: 'You came to the palace of the two princes, as the old man had instructed.


      there
      was nothing but two princes sitting on the throne. He saw you, unsurprisingly,
      but a sigh of "The dead brother."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687833
    m_Localized: How can I know if I don't?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687834
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687835
    m_Localized: 'You draw a sword and point it at the prince.


      The candle
      fires in front of the throne were extinguished at the same time and the palace
      was swallowed by a deep darkness.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687836
    m_Localized: The One Behind It All
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687837
    m_Localized: 'You cut the two princes with a sword, and the two princes fell
      in blood, but looked behind your back with fear.


      when you turned back
      and saw the old man standing there, and the pieces of the dirhams of his diary
      were taken from him, and his face became young, and became the middle-aged
      lord of the two princes.


      "Your Highness, I am the ultimate winner."
      The nobles laughed, "Your greatest mistake is to seal my body with your brother''s
      diary. The power of the diary kept me alive and made me wait for the opportunity
      to rewrite history."


      "You are a good knife, though a bit stupid." I
      believe, as His Highness believes, that only the dead can keep secrets."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687838
    m_Localized: If you can kill me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687839
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687840
    m_Localized: 'You pointed your sword at the nobles as quickly as possible.


      He
      had a dark gold in his hand, the walls of the palace began to be torn down
      and the old days were in the same place as the reality. The true people behind
      the scenes finally showed their faces.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687841
    m_Localized: The Heir's Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687842
    m_Localized: 'You do not touch the diary in battle. It is golden and the body
      of the nobles is frothing, and you have the opportunity to cut him off.


      You
      pick up the diary and turn the last page. It contains the true will of the
      Crown Prince to defeat the two princes and the aristocrats, avenge him and
      the king and find a true hero to inherit the throne.


      You decided:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687843
    m_Localized: I'll finish your last wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687844
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687845
    m_Localized: 'The diary is new and the palace thrones are slowly removed and
      the steps leading to the treasures are revealed.


      You have the last
      gift from the kingdom. After leaving the palace, the old castle collapsed as
      if it had finally put aside the venom and lies that have been on the ground
      for many years.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
